## How to Run the Project

### Phase A: Start the Backend API Server
1. Navigate to the root directory `c:\Users\anush\OneDrive\Desktop\MediFind`.
2. Run the start command:
   ```bash
   npm run dev
   ```
   *(Runs the server on `http://localhost:5000` using nodemon)*.

### Phase B: Start the React Frontend App
1. Navigate to the client directory `c:\Users\anush\OneDrive\Desktop\MediFind\client`.
2. Run the start command:
   ```bash
